### Phase 23 - Admin auth redirect normalization smoke tests

### Unauthenticated portal access should redirect once with a clean next target
GET http://localhost:3001/portal/dashboard

### Sign-in page should render without creating nested next URLs
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/sign-in?next=/portal/dashboard

### Nested sign-in next should be sanitized by the client after login
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/sign-in?next=%2Fauth%2Fsign-in%3Fnext%3D%2Fportal%2Fdashboard

### Direct sign-in without next should render normally
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/sign-in
